Bundled source code from the scoop package
===========================================

The SMOCL package incorporates source code derived from:

  Package: scoop
  Version: 0.2-1
  Author: Julien Chiquet
  License: GPL (>= 2)
  Original package URL:
  http://stat.genopole.cnrs.fr/logiciels/scoop

The source package used for this integration was obtained from:

  http://www.math-evry.cnrs.fr/logiciels/scoop

The bundled source implements the cooperative-Lasso optimization
used by SMOCL.

Files copied unchanged from scoop 0.2-1:

  R/vendor-scoop-cvscoop-class.R
  R/vendor-scoop-optim_bfgs.R
  R/vendor-scoop-optim_proximal.R
  R/vendor-scoop-scoop-model.R
  R/vendor-scoop-scoop.R
  R/vendor-scoop-scoopfit-class.R
  R/vendor-scoop-tree-solver.R
  R/vendor-scoop-working-set.R
  src/scoop.c
  src/scoop_utils.h

The original source code is distributed under GPL (>= 2).
